<p>The future looks grim indeed&hellip; for your foes.</p><p>You can target a creature affected by Bleak Outcome to consume up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> stacks, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">12, 16, 20, 22, 25</acronym> darkness damage to it for every stack and increasing your Spellpower by 4 per stacks for 6 turns.</p><p>While powered-up you can not apply new Bleak Outcome stacks.		</p><p>Damage is based on your Spellpower.</p>